# Large non-source trees not needed by Dockerfile.xcross. NOTE: arm64-runtime-libs
# and xtool-aarch64 ARE kept in context — the USE_PREBUILT_XTOOL=1 fast-path
# copies them. amd64-runtime-libs + xtool-amd64 are kept too — the
# Dockerfile.xcross-compose-amd64 image copies them. xtool/limd/xadi (source
# path) are fetched over the network.
darwin.artifactbundle
.build-macos
.xtool-linux-build
.xtool-sdk-build
.kn-ios-arm64-overlay
dist
*.log
